research, Douglas (Doug) Colkitt's network research and community repository,
Rohan Arun's community contributions, and Swapnil Jain's complex-network
witnesses. The selected five-stage result uses Jacob Sussman's formal
framework and Chafik Boukhalfa's stronger instantiation of the community
construction. Those results remain the work of their credited authors.

